OL,3,GNEWSA'Moolywed' cow bride seeks wedding
OL,4,Adress for big day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wedding dress and a suit are being
OL,7,Fsought for a cow and a bull to wear on
OL,8,Ftheir big day - when they are taking
OL,9,Fpart in a light-hearted farming
OL,10,Fcompetition next year.
OL,12,FFarmer Jen Husband, 24, from the
OL,13,FRoseland in Cornwall, said the animals
OL,14,Fwould be taking part in a pairs class
OL,15,Fat Devon County Show.
OL,17,FFive-year-old pedigree shorthorn
OL,18,FLongfield Tobias's Waterloo will be the
OL,19,Fbride, joining her son Bluebell
OL,20,FTrewithian in the fancy dress
OL,21,Fcompetition, with him taking on the
OL,22,Frole of groom.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
