OL,3,GNEWSA'Moolywed' cow bride seeks wedding
OL,4,Adress for big day
OL,5,
OL,6,FHusband has appealed for help finding
OL,7,Fcostumes that fit the 'moolyweds' and
OL,8,Fsaid "anything which resembles a dress
OL,9,Fof some sort, makes them look glorious
OL,10,Fand wedding day ready" would be well
OL,11,Freceived.
